 :out-of-scope
 ["Extension-defined primitive capabilities or ambient host authority"
  "Package-owned domain admission publication or effect execution"
  "Implicit package discovery installation activation or semantic fallback"
  "Unbounded prompt-bearing inspection or audit"
  "General-purpose WASI or ambient host services for decision modules"]

 :consumes
 ["fresh node-operator binding and local-control authority"
  "signed packages envelopes policies and posture"
  "current primitive capabilities grants trust sanctions and conformance"
  "host-built domain offers and current domain authority"]

 :produces
 ["inert package and conformance state"
  "generation-fenced durable or session activation"
  "admitted NSE decisions or typed refusals"
  "effective resource profiles and semantic registry selections"
  "derived authority guard attention and federation posture decisions"
  "bounded prompt-free operator inspection and cross-domain acceptance evidence"]}
